---
// "Viene en" radio pair (`fieldset.kind-pick`, field name `unit_type`); episodes are checked by default.
---
<fieldset class="kind-pick">
  <legend class="sr-only">Viene en</legend>
  <label><input type="radio" name="unit_type" value="episodio" checked /> <span>Viene en episodios</span></label>
  <label><input type="radio" name="unit_type" value="tomo" /> <span>Viene en tomos</span></label>
</fieldset>
